Id: fsys016w
Severity: WARN
Category: filesystem
Check: find_files

Dangling symbolic links were found in a directory where they are
usually clutter rather than a risk (help and documentation trees, icon
themes, home directories, runtime directories), so Tiger reports how
many and where instead of listing each one. The directories where each
dangling link is still listed individually (fsys013w) are set by
Tiger_FSScan_DetailDirs in tigerrc; set it to '*' to list them all.
To see the links themselves, run: find DIR -xdev -type l -xtype l
